/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (\042Why\040Should\040I\040Trust\040You\077\042\072\040Explaining\040the\040Predictions\040of\040Any\040Classifier)
/Author (Marco\040Tulio\040Ribeiro\054\040Sameer\040Singh\054\040Carlos\040Guestrin)
/Subject (Despite\040widespread\040adoption\054\040machine\040learning\040models\040remain\040mostly\040black\040boxes\056\040Understanding\040the\040reasons\040behind\040predictions\040is\054\040however\054\040quite\040important\040in\040assessing\040trust\054\040which\040is\040fundamental\040if\040one\040plans\040to\040take\040action\040based\040on\040a\040prediction\054\040or\040when\040choosing\040whether\040to\040deploy\040a\040new\040model\056\040Such\040understanding\040also\040provides\040insights\040into\040the\040model\054\040which\040can\040be\040used\040to\040transform\040an\040untrustworthy\040model\040or\040prediction\040into\040a\040trustworthy\040one\056\040In\040this\040work\054\040we\040propose\040LIME\054\040a\040novel\040explanation\040technique\040that\040explains\040the\040predictions\040of\040any\040classifier\040in\040an\040interpretable\040and\040faithful\040manner\054\040by\040learning\040an\040interpretable\040model\040locally\040varound\040the\040prediction\056\040We\040also\040propose\040a\040method\040to\040explain\040models\040by\040presenting\040representative\040individual\040predictions\040and\040their\040explanations\040in\040a\040non\055redundant\040way\054\040framing\040the\040task\040as\040a\040submodular\040optimization\040problem\056\040We\040demonstrate\040the\040flexibility\040of\040these\040methods\040by\040explaining\040different\040models\040for\040text\040\050e\056g\056\040random\040forests\051\040and\040image\040classification\040\050e\056g\056\040neural\040networks\051\056\040We\040show\040the\040utility\040of\040explanations\040via\040novel\040experiments\054\040both\040simulated\040and\040with\040human\040subjects\054\040on\040various\040scenarios\040that\040require\040trust\072\040deciding\040if\040one\040should\040trust\040a\040prediction\054\040choosing\040between\040models\054\040improving\040an\040untrustworthy\040classifier\054\040and\040identifying\040why\040a\040classifier\040should\040not\040be\040trusted\056)
/Keywords (13\040Aug\0402016\054\040Knowledge\040Discovery\040and\040Data\040Mining\054\040University\040of\040Washington)
